T4L-MSF_charmm - this runs the folded side of a three site calculation in T4
lysozyme, combining mutations to methionine at sites 17, 27, and 31.

Make a copy of the examples/engine/charmm or examples/engine/bladelib templates
and copy this directory into it, renaming it prep, and editing the path in
alf_info.py 'enginepath' to point to your charmm executable. Expected results
after production are in a file called Result.txt . You may also perform Potts
model analysis using scripts in examples/engine/PottsLM .
